            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Dictate Anywhere 2.7.1

- Fixed dictated searches in websites and apps so short phrases are inserted as query text, without sentence-style capitalization or an unwanted period.
- Improved search-field detection across native apps, browsers, filters, and command-style search boxes.
- Preserved proper nouns, acronyms, and custom vocabulary when formatting search queries.
]]></description>
